                                "sense_id": "8fecf37a-a2b7-370c-a257-ed55b1c5ec94",
                                "text": "Dey! Did you press the lift button? What? You have pressed the button for the tenth time?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bbdf578-17ea-4782-9c48-a089bbcd03f2",
                                "sense_id": "8fecf37a-a2b7-370c-a257-ed55b1c5ec94",
                                "text": "Dei, you think what, President’s Star Charity ah?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd812a5b-3760-47f0-9141-907ee2974754",
                                "sense_id": "8fecf37a-a2b7-370c-a257-ed55b1c5ec94",
                                "text": "If a player makes a silly mistake, he doesn’t wail when told to “wake up lah, dey”."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
